# Anti-Patterns

Categories of feature that look reasonable on a feature request but invert one of the invariants or beliefs. They are out of scope without an RFC. Cite by ID in PR review (e.g. "matches ANTI-1").

For positive identity, see [`core-belief.md`](core-belief.md).
For verifiable hard constraints, see [`invariants.md`](invariants.md).

