**Looks like:** <concrete examples — feature requests, PR shapes, naming hints that signal this category>

**Why not:** <2–3 sentences of rationale; reference the underlying invariant or belief>

**Instead:** <what to do when the underlying need is real; omit if the need does not exist for this project>

